{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初入道場，三禮已，互跪燒香散華，執手爐唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱已，一拜起，復跪，執爐至請。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請一禮，起歎云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歎已宣疏，或別述意，臨時自裁，然後禮讚。唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下皆倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行詵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": "1083a2301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_1083a2301", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
